//RS /// A private cwd for a `jet run`/`build`/`test` subprocess.
//RS ///
//RS /// `jet` writes compiled output to `.jet/build/<stem>.rs` + `.jet/build/<stem>` *relative
//RS /// to its own cwd* (Source/CmdCompile.rs `bin_path`/`stem`/`.jet/build`), keyed only
//RS /// by the source file's stem — not its full path. Two concurrent `jet`
//RS /// processes compiling different files that happen to share a stem (e.g. two
//RS /// `main.jet` fixtures) race on that shared `.jet/build/` path if both inherit
//RS /// the test harness's cwd (the repo root). Giving each such test its own cwd
//RS /// removes the shared namespace entirely, regardless of stem.
